    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poisons</a></i> </p><p><i>Null Gas is a unique type of gas that neutralizes oxygen in the air.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Null_Gas_Statistics_.28CL_12.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Null_Gas_Statistics_(CL_12)\">Null Gas Statistics (CL 12)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Atmosphere, Artificial, Poison </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature is exposed to Null Gas. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +14 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains exposed to Null Gas. </p><p><b>Special:</b> After 1 minute of exposure to Null Gas, a creature is affected as if in a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum\" title=\"Vacuum\">Vacuum</a> and must deal with the effects of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Suffocation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suffocation\">Suffocation</a>. </p>",
